L_1&= \{a^n wa^n|w  \in  \{a,b \}^* \}   \\ 
 L_2&= \{wxw^R | w,x  \in   \{a,b \}^*, |w|,|x|  \gt 0  \} 
 \end{aligned}[/latex]<br><br>Note that [latex]w^R[/latex] is the reversal of the string [latex]w[/latex]. Which of the following is/are TRUE?

